silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "MittensAnchorConcreteAnchorExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'MittensAnchorConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Mittens-the-cat: the individual domestic cat (Felis catus, TSN 183798, microchip ID 44B2F9) resident at the Tartu Animal Clinic's patient roster, the running colimit anchor for the entire encyclopedia; also, VetRecord_77: the electronic health record created at the Tartu Animal Clinic on 2026-05-18 for Mittens's annual exam; the record leg of the twelve-leg cocone; also, MicrochipID_44B2F9: the ISO 11784 microchip identifier implanted at the base of Mittens's neck; the identifier leg of the cocone." .
